## Naming

See `docs/Authority/NAMING.md` (canonical); `.cursor/rules/Naming-Vocabulary-Teensy-Looper.mdc` is agent pointer and global **action + scope** rule.
Reuse **passes**, **Capture**, **editPass**, **NoteEditSession**, slot, overdub, jam, JamAction, HITL baseline. A term a change introduces is **provisional** until it is registered in NAMING.md — see § Terminology delta.

## Verification

| Domain | Gates |
|--------|--------|
