| Note edit / overlap | Native `test_edit_apply` + HITL edit per `HITL-Edit-Test-Flow.mdc` |
| Persistence / overlay | Native persistence tests; manual overlay when UI/SD coupled |
| Live record display bugs | `openspec/changes/archive/2026-06-24-edit-record-display-length-mode/BUG.md` RC1–RC4 when in scope |

